      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im on warfarin for my heart rhythm but im feeling really low lately... i saw on a blog that st johns wort is like a super strong natural antidepressant. since its just a plant and not a synthetic chemical, it shouldn't really clash with my warfarin right? is it safe to just start taking it to help my mood?",
