    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that there might be some interaction, but im kinda skeptical about how much a little bit of a plant can actually mess with a medicine. i've heard from a few people that if you just take a small, low dose of the herb, the effect on the blood thinners is basically nothing. is there a way i could just try a very small amount of st johns wort to see if it helps my mood without actually making my warfarin stop working? like maybe just once a day in the morning?",
